ted\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:5976:## 2026-09-22 02:55:01 +07 — projection left dormant; H made the only identity in the de Bruijn VM design (owner decision D12)\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:5987:## 2026-09-22 02:58:30 +07 — blog rewritten to match the committed de Bruijn VM design (owner-authorized)\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:5998:## 2026-09-22 04:25:00 +07 — fable check folded into the de Bruijn VM design (D13-D16); DaoJing CBOR J0 fixtures reviewed, fix round dispatched\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6009:## 2026-09-22 04:52:00 +07 — DaoJing CBOR J0 frozen and committed (jing-cbor f5f71e95); J1 (JVM/Node codec) implemented, in review\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6019:## 2026-09-22 06:10:00 +07 — DaoJing CBOR J1 signed off and committed (jing-cbor 7968884b, 4f928dbd); J2 (Dart) dispatched\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6029:## 2026-09-22 07:40:00 +07 — DaoJing CBOR J2 (Dart) and J3 (conformance gate) implemented and hardened, awaiting combined architect sign-off\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6039:## 2026-09-22 07:45:00 +07 — DaoJing CBOR J2/J3 signed off and committed (jing-cbor e3917e69, 38328d3a); design-doc debt resolved; J0-J3 declared complete\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6049:## 2026-09-22 11:52:00 +07 — de Bruijn VM B0 (contract and normalizer) implemented and committed; master pushed; collab/ archived\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6060:## 2026-09-22 12:05:00 +07 — owner ruling: dao.space query equality stays kind-strict (first CBOR comparator gate resolved)\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6071:## 2026-09-22 12:20:00 +07 — owner ruling: min/max tie-break prefers finite precision (dao.space comparator gate fully resolved)\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6082:## 2026-09-22 12:28:00 +07 — min/max tie-break refined: shorter encoding wins over lexicographic byte order\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6093:## 2026-09-22 12:40:00 +07 — rebuild-readiness gate cleared; both DaoJing CBOR owner gates on step 3 now open\ndocs/orchestrator-log.md:6104:## 2026-09-22 14:20:00 +07 — de Bruijn VM B1 implemented, self-co